DOCKER AND DOCKER COMPOSE - COMPLETE HANDS-ON GUIDE

PHASE 13: DOCKERIZATION
=======================

WHY DOCKER?
-----------
Current Method:
source venv/bin/activate
uvicorn app:app --reload

Problems:
- Python must be installed.
- Packages must be installed manually.
- Configuration differs across machines.

Docker Solution:
- Package application and dependencies together.
- Run consistently anywhere.

PROJECT STRUCTURE
=================
my-loan-project/
│
├── app.py
├── langgraph_flow.py
