DOCKER COMPOSE
==============
Why Docker Compose?
- Manage multiple containers.
- Start app, Redis, and PostgreSQL together.

STEP 11 - CREATE COMPOSE FILE
=============================
File: docker-compose.yml

Content:
version: '3.9'

services:

  loan-ai:
    build: .
    ports:
      - "8000:8000"
    depends_on:
      - redis
      - postgres

  redis:
    image: redis
    ports:
      - "6379:6379"

  postgres:
    image: postgres
    environment:
      POSTGRES_DB: loandb
      POSTGRES_USER: postgres
      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: postgres
    ports:
      - "5432:5432"

STEP 12 - START ALL SERVICES
============================
Command:
docker compose up

Expected:
FastAPI started
Redis started
PostgreSQL started

STEP 13 - RUN IN BACKGROUND
===========================
Command:
docker compose up -d

STEP 14 - CHECK CONTAINERS
==========================
Command:
